{"about_the_game":"Demo conian first 4 levels of the game<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/separator_text_fight_eng.png?t=1753111348\" /></div><br>In your crusade you will have to destroy hordes of demons and defeat the king of the Marsia Federation.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/gd_fight_1.gif?t=1753111348\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/separator_text_parkor_eng.png?t=1753111348\" /></div><br>Your character is a professional parkour athlete, capable of <strong>double jumps</strong> and <strong>accelerations</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/gd_jump_1_25fps.gif?t=1753111348\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/separator_text_interactive_eng.png?t=1753111348\" /></div><br>Drink cola, break bottles on your head.<br>The world of the Marsia Federation is filled with interactive environments that can help you on your journey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/separator_text_weapon_eng.png?t=1753111348\" /></div><br>Crush demons using <strong>cups</strong> and <strong>golden brushes</strong>, as well as other, very practical weapons!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115560/extras/Flag_Separator.png?t=1753111348\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c